# CODEOWNERS — fs-packages (The Armory)
#
# fs-packages is the OIDC Trusted-Publishing root for every @script-development/*
# package consumed across the fleet. Every change requires review from a repo
# admin — the CI/release surface (.github/**) is the highest-leverage supply-chain
# path here, so the same owner set guards the whole repo.
#
# Mirrors phpstan-warroom-rules' CODEOWNERS shape (a single global owner rule).
# phpstan routes to its @script-development/phpstan-warroom-admins team; fs-packages
# has no equivalent dedicated team — its access model is the six individual admin
# collaborators below (the "6 admins" the security baseline tracks; Sapper L5).
# Listing them by handle keeps the rule valid (a CODEOWNERS team without repo
# access is silently ignored). If an `fs-packages-admins` org team is later created
# with repo access, collapse these six handles into that single team handle.

